The registry-first sample tests/registry/lv.jsonl contains addresses, postcodes and coordinates
from the State Address Register of the Republic of Latvia (Valsts adrešu reģistrs), kept by the
State Land Service (Valsts zemes dienests), as published in its open data ("Valsts adrešu
reģistra atvērtie dati"): addresses of buildings and land units (AW_EKA.CSV), streets, villages,
parishes, towns and municipalities, data of 2026-10-29, downloaded on 2026-10-30. Izmantoti Valsts
adrešu reģistra informācijas sistēmas dati. Source: Valsts zemes dienests, Valsts adrešu
reģistrs, 2026-10-29 (https://data.gov.lv/dati/lv/dataset/varis-atvertie-dati).
Used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: the files were joined by their codes (tests/registry/varis-csv.sql) and a sample drawn;
the spelt query forms were constructed from the register's fields, not by Valsts zemes dienests,
which has not approved this sample. Per-case file checksums and retrieval dates are recorded in
the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/lv.md records the upstream checksums.
